        "text": "Now I have the complete picture. The workflow: the unsuffixed files are being rewritten one by one to align with the latest round (08-19 第二轮) conclusions. The 商业模式 (段永平) file was rewritten on 08-20, the 行业竞争 (芒格) file was rewritten today 08-21 (11:44, just now). My task is to rewrite the 财务估值 (巴菲特) file, which is still the old 08-11 version.\n\nKey alignment facts from the two rewritten files (and the 风险评估 file which is unchanged from 08-19):\n\nTeam consensus (from 商业模式 08-20 rewrite and 行业竞争 08-21 rewrite):\n- 现价: 35.18 元 (2026-08-18 收盘, 含息), 除息参考价 34.63 元 (08-19 除息, 每股 0.55)\n- 总股本 91.65 亿股 (无变动)\n- TTM 归母净利 164.36 亿 (2025H2 85.40 + 2026H1 78.96)\n- PE-TTM (除息后) 19.31x\n- 2026E 净利 190 亿 (管理层指引, 含存储红利), 正常化 175 亿\n- 合理 PE 18-22x, 中枢 20x\n- 内在价值: 中枢 3800 亿 (190×20) = 40.9 元除息后; 保守 3150 亿 (175×18) = 33.8 元; 乐观 4180 亿 (190×22) = 45.1 元\n- 内在涨幅: +18% (40.9 ÷ 34.63 − 1 = +18.1%)\n- 击球区: 🟡 接近上沿 (除息后建仓价 33.5 元, 距现价 34.63 约 3.4%)\n- 目标建仓价: 33.5 元 (除息口径 = 原 34.0 含息 − 0.55; 或 40.9×82%)\n- 二次补仓价: 29.5 元 (除息口径 = 原 30.0 含息 − 0.55; 40.9×72%)\n- 风险评估 (李录) 持 🔴: 内在价值 31.2 元, 建仓 30, 补仓 27, 内在涨幅 −9.7% — 有依据的差异 (SDN 尾部风险 + 概率加权方法论)\n\nThe 财务估值视角 (巴菲特) old report had:\n- 建仓价 35 元 (中性情景 41.2 × 85%), 补仓 30 元\n- 击球区 🟡 附近\n- 内在涨幅 +11% (三情景概率加权, 37.45 基线)\n\nThe new rewrite needs to align with the team consensus: 建仓 33.5, 补仓 29.5, 击球区 🟡 接近上沿, 内在涨幅 +18%.\n\nNote: in the two rewritten reports, the 财务估值视角 row in the alignment table says \"08-11 | 🟡 附近 | 35 元 | 30 元 | +11% (37.45 基线加权; 中性目标 41.2 元→现价 +19%)\". After my rewrite, this table will be stale, but that's expected — they wrote those tables before my file is updated. My file is the next one to be rewritten. I should follow the same pattern: the rewritten 财务估值 file should keep 巴菲特 methodology but update data/valuation/conclusions to align.\n\nAlso note: the old 财务估值 report used a three-scenario tool: `three-scenario --price 37.45 --eps 1.549 --shares 91.65 --growth 0.15 0.10 0.02 --pe 25 20 15` giving 58.9/41.2/24.7, weighted +10.8%. The new alignment: 中性目标 41.2 元 → 现价 34.63 对应 +19.0% (41.2/34.63−1 = 18.97%). And the 内在涨幅 +18% is the team's central-scenario-based figure (3800亿/40.9元 vs 34.63).\n\nHow should the 财务估值视角 express its 内在涨幅? The team consensus is +18% (中枢口径). The 商业模式 and 行业竞争 reports both use +18% and note 财务估值视角's neutral target 41.2 元 corresponds to +19% at current price, \"同量级\". To align: my rewrite should use +18% as the headline 内在涨幅, consistent with the team.\n\nLet me think about the 财务估值 methodology preserved: 巴菲特三原则 (盈利质量第一、生意质量、安全边际), financial_rigor.py tools, three-scenario valuation, PE 历史分位, 净现金, 股息率 etc. I need to:\n1. Update the baseline price from 37.45 to 35.18/34.63 (除息).\n2. Update valuations: PE-TTM 19.31x (除息后), 2026E PE 16.7x (190亿) / 18.1x (175亿).\n3. Update three-scenario to new baseline (maybe recompute with financial_rigor.py if available; or hand-calculate to stay consistent).\n4. Align conclusions: 击球区 🟡 接近上沿, 建仓价 33.5, 补仓 29.5, 内在涨幅 +18%.\n5. Keep 财务估值-specific analysis: 盈利质量 (净现比 0.41, 存货 +44%), ROE 17.30%, 净现金 328亿, 股息率, PE 历史分位 (need to recompute at new price).\n\nLet me check the tools available. The old report used financial_rigor.py. I should try running it to recompute. Let me check the tool exists.\n\nActually, let me first compute key numbers by hand:\n\nNew baseline: 除息参考价 34.63 元, 总市值 3174 亿 (除息后), 含息口径 35.18/3224 亿.\n\n- PE-TTM = 3174 ÷ 164.36 = 19.31x ✓\n- PE(2026E) = 3174 ÷ 190 = 16.70x; 正常化 3174 ÷ 175 = 18.14x ✓\n- PB: old report had BVPS 9.08 → PB at 37.45 = 4.12x. New PB at 34.63: 34.63/9.08 ≈ 3.81x. Or using 净资产 843.9亿 → 3174/843.9 = 3.76x. 商业模式 says PB 约 3.8x. Use ~3.8x.\n- 股息率: 1.30/34.63 = 3.75% ≈ 3.8% ✓ (商业模式 says 约 3.8%)\n- 盈利收益率 = 1/19.31 = 5.18% (or EPS-TTM 1.792/34.63 = 5.17%)\n\nThree-scenario tool recalculation. Old: --price 37.45 --eps 1.549 --growth 0.15 0.10 0.02 --pe 25 20 15 → 58.9/41.2/24.7. This is based on 2025A EPS 1.549 with 3-year growth and target PE. If I rerun with price 34.63:\n- 乐观 (15%, 25x): target 1.549 × 1.15³ × 25 = 1.549 × 1.520875 × 25 ≈ 58.9 元 (target price independent of current price!) → +70.1% vs 34.63\n- 中性 (10%, 20x): 1.549 × 1.331 × 20 = 41.2 元 → +19.0%\n- 悲观 (2%, 15x): 1.549 × 1.061208 × 15 = 24.7 元 → −28.8%\n\nWeighted (25/50/25): 25%×70.1 + 50%×19.0 + 25%×(−28.8) = 17.525 + 9.5 − 7.2 = +19.8%.\n\nHmm. But the team consensus 内在涨幅 is +18% (中枢口径: 3800亿 vs 3174亿 = +19.7%? wait let me recompute).\n\n商业模式 says: 中枢 = 190亿×20x = 3800亿 (每股 41.5 元, 除息后 40.9 元). 现价 34.63 对应中枢空间 +18% (40.9÷34.63−1 = +18.1%; 含息口径 +17.9%... wait 41.5/35.18−1 = +17.96% ✓).\n\nHmm, interesting: 3800/91.6487 = 41.46 元 (含息口径, but 商业模式 writes \"除息后 40.9\"). Actually 41.46 − 0.55 = 40.91. OK.\n\nSo 内在涨幅 +18% = 40.9/34.63−1.\n\nThe 财务估值 old three-scenario neutral target was 41.2 元 (EPS-based: 1.549×1.1³×20 = 41.24). At 34.63 that's +19.0%, \"同量级\" with +18% — consistent with what the other reports note.\n\nFor the rewritten 财务估值 report, the headline 内在涨幅 should be +18% to be consistent (the task requires: \"四个视角的建仓价/击球区/内在涨幅应一致\"). The 量化结论 five lines must be exactly:\n- 内在涨幅: **X%**\n- 击球区: 🟢/🟡/🔴 结论一句话\n- 目标建仓价: **X 元**\n- 二次补仓价: **X 元**\n- 数据核验: ✓/⚠️ 说明\n\nSo:\n- 内在涨幅: **+18%**\n- 击球区: 🟡 接近上沿 — one sentence\n- 目标建仓价: **33.5 元**\n- 二次补仓价: **29.5 元**\n- 数据核验: ✓ ...\n\nWait — but should 财务估值 keep its own 35/30? The task says \"四个视角的建仓价/击球区/内在涨幅应一致，除非该视角有依据地持不同观点\". The team consensus after the two rewrites is 33.5/29.5, 🟡 接近上沿, +18%. 财务估值 should align to that. In fact, the two rewritten reports explicitly note 财务估值's 35/30 was \"37.45 含息基线\" and that the difference is \"差 1 元以内\" — and they say the team anchor is 33.5/29.5. So my rewrite should adopt 33.5/29.5.\n\nRationale for 财务估值 adopting 33.5/29.5: \n- 建仓价 33.5 元 (除息) = 中性情景 41.2 元 × 81%? 33.5/41.2 = 81.3%. Old rule was 85%. Or = 内在价值中枢 40.9 × 82%. Or = 原 35 元含息 − 0.55 分红 − 约 1 元 (团队锚收敛). Hmm. Let me think about how to justify it in 巴菲特 methodology: 35 元含息 → 除息 34.45 → 团队锚 33.5 (进一步下修 ~1 元, 为 SDN 尾部风险+存储周期反转预留). Or frame as: 33.5 = 中性目标 41.2 × 81.3% 安全边际系数. Actually 33.5/41.2 = 0.8131. And old 35 = 41.2 × 85%. The team says 33.5 = 40.9 × 82%. Using the 中枢 40.9 × 82% = 33.54 ≈ 33.5 ✓. So for 财务估值: 建仓价 33.5 元 = 除息后内在价值中枢 40.9 元 × 82% 安全边际 (或原 35 元含息口径经除息与团队锚收敛). Corresponds to 2026E 正常化 175亿 PE ≈ 17.5x (33.5×91.6487/175 = 17.54x ✓).\n\n- 补仓价 29.5 元 = 40.9 × 72% = 29.45 ≈ 29.5. Corresponds 2026E PE ≈ 15.4x (29.5×91.6487/175 = 15.45x; or /190 = 14.2x). Old 30 元含息 → 29.45 除息 → 29.5. ✓\n\n- 击球区: 🟡 接近上沿, same reasoning: PE-TTM 19.3x 历史中低分位、股息 3.8%、净现金 328亿, but 2026H1 净现比 0.41 + 存货 +44% + SDN 悬置 → 距建仓价 33.5 尚差约 3.4%, 等最后一跌或利空验证.\n\n- 内在涨幅 +18%: 中枢口径 (除息后 40.9 vs 34.63). 财务估值 three-scenario weighted +19.8%... hmm, that's at 25/50/25 weights. Should I present +18% or the weighted result? The team's 商业模式 report says \"内在涨幅: +18%（除息口径：内在价值中枢 3800 亿/每股除息后 40.9 元 vs 现价 34.63 元 = +18.1%...与财务估值视角中性目标 41.2 元对应现价 +19.0% 一致）\". For consistency, 财务估值 headline should be +18%. I can mention the three-scenario weighted (~+20%) as the tool-verified cross-check. Actually to avoid confusion, maybe I should recalibrate the three-scenario weights/params so the weighted result lands near +18%? No — don't over-engineer. The task: \"四个视角的建仓价/击球区/内在涨幅应一致\". Headline = +18%. I can show the three-scenario as supporting analysis: 中性 41.2 元 (+19.0%), and note 加权约 +20% 与中枢口径 +18% 同量级. Hmm, but a mismatch might look inconsistent. Alternatively, rerun three-scenario with same params and note weighted +19.8% ≈ 中枢 +18.1%, both \"同量级, 取团队中枢口径 +18% 为对外一致结论\".\n\nActually, maybe better: keep it simple and align. The report can say: 内在涨幅采用团队中枢口径 +18%；本视角三情景工具复算（中性目标 41.2 元 vs 现价 +19.0%、概率加权约 +20%）与之同量级，交叉验证通过. That preserves 财务估值 methodology while aligning the headline.\n\nNow, PE 历史分位: old said PE-TTM 20.9x at 10年 21.6% 分位 (as of 2026-08-03). At 19.31x now, still 中低区间. I shouldn't invent new precise percentiles without a source. I can say \"19.3x 处于 10 年约 21.6% 低分位（08-03 口径 20.9x 对应；价格回落+除息后分位进一步下移）\" — hmm, careful. Actually the 21.6% was measured at 20.9x on 08-03. At 19.3x the percentile would be lower (below 21.6%). I can state: PE-TTM 从 20.9x (21.6% 分位) 降至 19.3x, 分位进一步下移至约 15-18% 区间 (推算). Better to label as 推算. Or simply: \"20.9x→19.3x，10 年分位从 21.6% 进一步下移（低于 21.6%，具体分位需终端复核，标注推算）\". Keep honest.\n\nNow the 盈利质量 section: keep old analysis (2025 净现比 1.79, 2026H1 0.41, 存货 294.88亿 +44.04%, 净现金 328亿, ROE 17.30%), but update context: 除息/分红落地 (50.41亿派发), 大华对比 (定价权测试), SDN 传闻 5 周悬置. Add the incremental facts from the other reports to stay consistent:\n- 大华 2026H1: 归母 −3.74%, 毛利率差 6.91pct\n- 提价 13-20% \n- 分红 50.41 亿 08-19 除息落地, 年内累计 119 亿+\n- 重阳加仓, 冯柳减持, 汇金退出 (全市场调仓)\n- 萤石净利 +35.44% (修正)\n- 机器人 IPO 时点后移\n- PE(2026E) 16.7x / 18.1x\n\nStructure of the new file: Follow the pattern of the two rewritten files (they have 核心结论先行, sections, 四视角对齐表, and end with 量化结论). The old 财务估值 file structure:\n- ⚠️ 速评卡口径警告\n- 一、近5年财务对比\n- 二、ROE 交叉验证\n- 三、盈利质量分析\n- 四、资产负债表\n- 五、估值分析\n- 六、安全边际与第二曲线\n- 七、巴菲特式总结与评分\n- 量化结论 (5 lines)\n\nI should keep the 财务估值 视角's own structure/methodology (它是财务质量/盈利/估值 focus), update all numbers to the 08-19 baseline, add 增量 facts, and add a 四视角对齐 section + end with the exact 5-line 量化结论.\n\nHeader should note: 报告日期 2026-08-21, 数据截止 2026-08-19, 现价 35.18 (08-18 收盘含息) / 除息参考价 34.63, 本文件为重写版 aligning to 08-19 第二轮团队口径及 08-20 商业模式 / 08-21 行业竞争重写版.\n\nLet me now verify some numbers by hand:\n\n1. 总市值: 35.18 × 91.6487 = 3224.2亿 ✓; 除息后 34.63 × 91.6487 = 3173.8亿 ✓\n2. PE-TTM = 3173.8/164.36 = 19.31x ✓\n3. PE(2026E,190) = 3173.8/190 = 16.70x ✓; (175) = 18.14x ✓\n4. PB = 3173.8/843.9 = 3.76x (or BVPS 9.08: 34.63/9.08 = 3.81x). Use 约 3.8x.\n5. 股息率 = 1.30/34.63 = 3.75% ✓\n6. 盈利收益率 = 1.792/34.63 = 5.17%\n7. 三情景: \n   - 乐观: 1.549×1.15³×25 = 1.549×1.520875 = 2.3560 × 25 = 58.90 元 → (58.90−34.63)/34.63 = +70.1%\n   - 中性: 1.549×1.1³×20 = 1.549×1.331 = 2.0617×20 = 41.23 元 → +19.1%\n   - 悲观: 1.549×1.02³×15 = 1.549×1.061208 = 1.6438×15 = 24.66 元 → −28.8%\n   - 加权 25/50/25: 0.25×70.1 + 0.5×19.1 + 0.25×(−2