s: 33.5 = 中性目标 41.2 × 81.3% 安全边际系数. Actually 33.5/41.2 = 0.8131. And old 35 = 41.2 × 85%. The team says 33.5 = 40.9 × 82%. Using the 中枢 40.9 × 82% = 33.54 ≈ 33.5 ✓. So for 财务估值: 建仓价 33.5 元 = 除息后内在价值中枢 40.9 元 × 82% 安全边际 (或原 35 元含息口径经除息与团队锚收敛). Corresponds to 2026E 正常化 175亿 PE ≈ 17.5x (33.5×91.6487/175 = 17.54x ✓).\n\n- 补仓价 29.5 元 = 40.9 × 72% = 29.45 ≈ 29.5. Corresponds 2026E PE ≈ 15.4x (29.5×91.6487/175 = 15.45x; or /190 = 14.2x). Old 30 元含息 → 29.45 除息 → 29.5. ✓\n\n- 击球区: 🟡 接近上沿, same reasoning: PE-TTM 19.3x 历史中低分位、股息 3.8%、净现金 328亿, but 2026H1 净现比 0.41 + 存货 +44% + SDN 悬置 → 距建仓价 33.5 尚差约 3.4%, 等最后一跌或利空验证.\n\n- 内在涨幅 +18%: 中枢口径 (除息后 40.9 vs 34.63). 财务估值 three-scenario weighted +19.8%... hmm, that's at 25/50/25 weights. Should I present +18% or the weighted result? The team's 商业模式 report says \"内在涨幅: +18%（除息口径：内在价值中枢 3800 亿/每股除息后 40.9 元 vs 现价 34.63 元 = +18.1%...与财务估值视角中性目标 41.2 元对应现价 +19.0% 一致）\". For consistency, 财务估值 headline should be +18%. I can mention the three-scenario weighted (~+20%) as the tool-verified cross-check. Actually to avoid confusion, maybe I should recalibrate the three-scenario weights/params so the weighted result lands near +18%? No — don't over-engineer. The task: \"四个视角的建仓价/击球区/内在涨幅应一致\". Headline = +18%. I can show the three-scenario as supporting analysis: 中性 41.2 元 (+19.0%), and note 加权约 +20% 与中枢口径 +18% 同量级. Hmm, but a mismatch might look inconsistent. Alternatively, rerun three-scenario with same params and note weighted +19.8% ≈ 中枢 +18.1%, both \"同量级, 取团队中枢口径 +18% 为对外一致结论\".\n\nActually, maybe better: keep it simple and align. The report can say: 内在涨幅采用团队中枢口径 +18%；本视角三情景工具复算（中性目标 41.2 元 vs 现价 +19.0%、概率加权约 +20%）与之同量级，交叉验证通过. That preserves 财务估值 methodology while aligning the headline.\n\nNow, PE 历史分位: old said PE-TTM 20.9x at 10年 21.6% 分位 (as of 2026-08-03). At 19.31x now, still 中低区间. I shouldn't invent new precise percentiles without a source. I can say \"19.3x 处于 10 年约 21.6% 低分位（08-03 口径 20.9x 对应；价格回落+除息后分位进一步下移）\" — hmm, careful. Actually the 21.6% was measured at 20.9x on 08-03. At 19.3x the percentile would be lower (below 21.6%). I can state: PE-TTM 从 20.9x (21.6% 分位) 降至 19.3x, 分位进一步下移至约 15-18% 区间 (推算). Better to label as 推算. Or simply: \"20.9x→19.3x，10 年分位从 21.6% 进一步下移（低于 21.6%，具体分位需终端复核，标注推算）\". Keep honest.\n\nNow the 盈利质量 section: keep old analysis (2025 净现比 1.79, 2026H1 0.41, 存货 294.88亿 +44.04%, 净现金 328亿, ROE 17.30%), but update context: 除息/分红落地 (50.41亿派发), 大华对比 (定价权测试), SDN 传闻 5 周悬置. Add the incremental facts from the other reports to stay consistent:\n- 大华 2026H1: 归母 −3.74%, 毛利率差 6.91pct\n- 提价 13-20% \n- 分红 50.41 亿 08-19 除息落地, 年内累计 119 亿+\n- 重阳加仓, 冯柳减持, 汇金退出 (全市场调仓)\n- 萤石净利 +35.44% (修正)\n- 机器人 IPO 时点后移\n- PE(2026E) 16.7x / 18.1x\n\nStructure of the new file: Follow the pattern of the two rewritten files (they have 核心结论先行, sections, 四视角对齐表, and end with 量化结论). The old 财务估值 file structure:\n- ⚠️ 速评卡口径警告\n- 一、近5年财务对比\n- 二、ROE 交叉验证\n- 三、盈利质量分析\n- 四、资产负债表\n- 五、估值分析\n- 六、安全边际与第二曲线\n- 七、巴菲特式总结与评分\n- 量化结论 (5 lines)\n\nI should keep the 财务估值 视角's own structure/methodology (它是财务质量/盈利/估值 focus), update all numbers to the 08-19 baseline, add 增量 facts, and add a 四视角对齐 section + end with the exact 5-line 量化结论.\n\nHeader should note: 报告日期 2026-08-21, 数据截止 2026-08-19, 现价 35.18 (08-18 收盘含息) / 除息参考价 34.63, 本文件为重写版 aligning to 08-19 第二轮团队口径及 08-20 商业模式 / 08-21 行业竞争重写版.\n\nLet me now verify some numbers by hand:\n\n1. 总市值: 35.18 × 91.6487 = 3224.2亿 ✓; 除息后 34.63 × 91.6487 = 3173.8亿 ✓\n2. PE-TTM = 3173.8/164.36 = 19.31x ✓\n3. PE(2026E,190) = 3173.8/190 = 16.70x ✓; (175) = 18.14x ✓\n4. PB = 3173.8/843.9 = 3.76x (or BVPS 9.08: 34.63/9.08 = 3.81x). Use 约 3.8x.\n5. 股息率 = 1.30/34.63 = 3.75% ✓\n6. 盈利收益率 = 1.792/34.63 = 5.17%\n7. 三情景: \n   - 乐观: 1.549×1.15³×25 = 1.549×1.520875 = 2.3560 × 25 = 58.90 元 → (58.90−34.63)/34.63 = +70.1%\n   - 中性: 1.549×1.1³×20 = 1.549×1.331 = 2.0617×20 = 41.23 元 → +19.1%\n   - 悲观: 1.549×1.02³×15 = 1.549×1.061208 = 1.6438×15 = 24.66 元 → −28.8%\n   - 加权 25/50/25: 0.25×70.1 + 0.5×19.1 + 0.25×(−28.8) = 17.53 + 9.55 − 7.20 = +19.9%\n   \n   Hmm old report said 中性 41.2 元 (+10.1% at 37.45) — 41.23/37.45−1 = +10.1% ✓. 乐观 58.9 (+57.3%) ✓. 悲观 24.7 (−34.2%) ✓ (24.66/37.45−1 = −34.15% ≈ −34.2%).\n\n8. 建仓价 33.5: 33.5 × 91.6487 = 3070.2亿 → 2026E(190) PE = 16.16x; (175) = 17.54x. TTM: 3070.2/164.36 = 18.68x. 股息率 at 33.5: 1.30/33.5 = 3.88%. PB: 33.5/9.08 = 3.69x.\n9. 补仓价 29.5: 29.5 × 91.6487 = 2703.6亿 → 2026E(190) = 14.23x; (175) = 15.45x; TTM = 16.45x. 股息率 = 4.41%. PB = 3.25x.\n10. 内在价值中枢 40.9: 40.9 × 91.6487 = 3748.4亿 ≈ 3750亿 ✓ (行业竞争 says \"3800 亿（除息后约 3750 亿）\"). Hmm interesting: 3800 亿 is the 含息 valuation; after 除息 it's 3750 亿. And 40.9 = 41.46−0.55? 3800/91.6487 = 41.46 元. 41.46−0.55 = 40.91 ✓. OK.\n11. 保守 3150亿: 3150/91.6487 = 34.37 元; 除息后 33.8 ✓ (34.37−0.55 = 33.82). vs 现价 34.63: 33.82/34.63−1 = −2.3% ✓.\n12. 乐观 4180亿: 4180/91.6487 = 45.61 元; 除息后 45.06 ≈ 45.1 ✓. +30.1% ✓ (45.06/34.63−1 = 30.1%).\n13. 中性目标 41.2 vs 现价 34.63: +19.0% ✓ (41.23/34.63−1 = 19.06%).\n\nAll consistent. \n\nNow regarding tools: AGENTS.md says use financial_rigor.py. Let me check whether the tool exists and can run. I could run `python3 tools/financial_rigor.py verify-valuation --price 34.63 ...` to get tool-verified numbers. Let me check the tool file first.\n\nAlso, the memory notes: \"investment-team 重复轮次工作流 — 同公司重跑时增量更新+日期后缀新文件\" — so for reruns, they create date-suffixed new files. But this task asks me to REWRITE the no-suffix 财务估值 file (like the 商业模式 08-20 and 行业竞争 08-21 rewrites did). The task explicitly says: \"重写 reports/002415海康威视-财务估值-巴菲特视角.md\" — so rewrite in place. Good, matches the pattern of the other two rewrites.\n\nAlso from memory: \"轮次间必查除权/股本变动（10转4教训）+基线价时效（招行 40.36 实为 08-03 旧价教训）\" — so I must verify 除权/股本: 除息 0.55 元 on 08-19, 股本 91.65 亿 unchanged (no 送转). ✓ Already verified via the reports. Good — I should include 股本/除息核验 in the report.\n\nLet me check the tools directory and run financial_rigor.py to verify my calculations. Let me also check what verify-valuation needs: --price --eps --bvps --dividend. Old: --price 37.45 --eps 1.792 --bvps 9.08 --dividend 1.30 → PE-TTM 20.90, 盈利收益率 4.79%, PB 4.12, ROE 19.74%, 股息率 3.47%.\n\nNew: --price 34.63 --eps 1.792 --bvps 9.08 --dividend 1.30 → PE-TTM 19.32x, PB 3.81x, 股息率 3.75%, 盈利收益率 5.17%.\n\nLet me run the tool to confirm it works and get exact output. Also verify-market-cap --price 34.63 --shares 91.65e8.\n\nThen three-scenario --price 34.63 --eps 1.549 --shares 91.65 --growth 0.15 0.10 0.02 --pe 25 20 15.\n\nLet me try running these. If the tool fails (non-interactive mode issues), I'll hand-compute with exact arithmetic as documented.\n\nOne question: should the 财务估值 report's three-scenario keep --price 34.63 (除息后)? Yes, baseline is 除息参考价 34.63.\n\nNow about PE 历史分位 — old report cited \"10 年 21.6% 分位（同花顺 iFind，2026-08-03）\". At the lower price now, percentile is lower. I'll note: \"20.9x→19.3x 后，10 年分位从 21.6% 进一步下移至约 15% 档（推算，终端精确值待核）\" — label as 推算/待核 to be honest. Actually, since I can't verify, I could avoid giving a precise new number and just say \"分位进一步下移\". That's cleaner and honest.\n\nAlso 券商综合目标价 49.42 元 (+27.9% at 37.45) — hmm, at 34.63 that's +42.7%. It's a stale consensus from before. I could keep it but note it's 08-11 口径. Actually 49.42/34.63−1 = +42.7%. This is a bull-side reference. Might keep with note. Or drop to keep the report clean. The old report used it in 5.3. I'll keep a shortened mention with the 口径 caveat.\n\nNow, also the 财务估值 rewrite should include the 四视角对齐表 similar to the other two rewrites (rows: 行业竞争 08-21 重写 🟡 接近上沿 33.5/29.5 +18%; 风险评估 08-19 🔴 未到 30/27 −9.7%; 商业模式 08-20 重写 🟡 接近上沿 33.5/29.5 +18%; 财务估值 (本报告) 08-21 重写 🟡 接近上沿 33.5/29.5 +18%). And an 对齐说明 with rationale for adopting team anchors, plus note 风险评估's justified 🔴 difference.\n\nLet me now plan the structure of the rewritten 财务估值 report:\n\n# 海康威视(002415.SZ)财务质量/盈利/估值——巴菲特视角\n> header: 报告日期 2026-08-21, 数据截止 2026-08-19, 现价 35.18 (含息)/34.63 (除息参考), 股本 91.65亿, 本文件为重写版 aligned to 08-19 第二轮